      <section class="project-section card" id="tabl">
        <h2>Tableau 2019-2020 Euro Soccer Info</h2>

        <p>Here is a Tableau Project I made for fun. It is the culmination of the stats from the top European soccer leagues in the 2019-2020 seasons. The leagues are:</p>

        <ul>
          <li>Belgium - Jupiler League</li>
          <li>England - Premier League</li>
          <li>France - Le Championnat</li>
          <li>Germany - Bundesliga</li>
          <li>Italy - Serie A</li>
          <li>Netherlands - Eredivisie</li>
          <li>Portugal - Liga I</li>
          <li>Spain - La Liga Primera Division</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="tableau-card">
          <div class="tableauPlaceholder" id="viz1702420136862">
            <noscript>
              <a href="#">
                <img alt=" " src="https://public.tableau.com/static/images/We/WebProjectSoccerStatsEurope2019-2020JackEstes2023/AwayGoalsScoredbyHomeStats/1_rss.png" />
              </a>
            </noscript>
            <object class="tableauViz" style="display:none;">
              <param name="host_url" value="https%3A%2F%2Fpublic.tableau.com%2F" />
              <param name="embed_code_version" value="3" />
              <param name="site_root" value="" />
              <param name="name" value="WebProjectSoccerStatsEurope2019-2020JackEstes2023/AwayGoalsScoredbyHomeStats" />
              <param name="tabs" value="yes" />
              <param name="toolbar" value="yes" />
              <param name="static_image" value="https://public.tableau.com/static/images/We/WebProjectSoccerStatsEurope2019-2020JackEstes2023/AwayGoalsScoredbyHomeStats/1.png" />
              <param name="animate_transition" value="yes" />
              <param name="display_static_image" value="yes" />
              <param name="display_spinner" value="yes" />
              <param name="display_overlay" value="yes" />
              <param name="display_count" value="yes" />
              <param name="language" value="en-US" />
            </object>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>Here is the <a class="accent-link" href="/assets/Top Europe Soccer League Statistics.xlsx" download>spreadsheet</a> of the data for the Tableau Project above!</p>
